---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Phil Burney | Phil Burney for Commissioner"
  description="Learn about Phil Burney, candidate for Rutherford County Commissioner, District 5."
>
  <section class="section about-hero">
    <p class="tag">About</p>
    <h1>About Me</h1>
    <p class="muted lead">
      I've lived here all my life, and believe a community as great as this one deserves a
      government that works for them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-section">
    <h2>My Story</h2>
    <p>
      I've been a lifelong resident of WNC. I grew up in neighboring Polk County, and I have always loved living here. The scenery, the people, and the deep sense of community that living here brings have always kept me coming back.
    </p>
    <p>
      After I graduated high school, I went to NC State, where I graduated at the top of my class with a Bachelor's Degree in Computer Science. I didn't see myself living in a city — I wanted to move back to the place I called home my whole life. After a bit of effort, I found a remote job and bought a home in Rutherford County soon after. I've lived here ever since, and the more I've lived here, the more I believe that we can make this an even better place to live, work, and play.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-section">
    <h2>Why I'm Running</h2>
    <p>
      I’m running because we have so many opportunities to improve the place that we all call home, 
      and we are leaving too many of those opportunities on the table.  I want to ensure that we are
      bringing every possible opportunity to the county, whether that be for housing, jobs, or education.      </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-section">
    <h2>Why I Can Do the Job</h2>
    <p>
      I believe that my passion for this county, and my problem-solving skillset makes me the best 
      pick for County Commissioner. We need a leader in government who will listen to and advocate for the 
      people they serve while seeking solutions to the problems we all face.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>Ready to support Phil?</h2>
      <p>Help bring results-focused leadership to Rutherford County District 5.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/donations" class="btn btn-primary">Support the Campaign</a>
        <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline-light">Read the Platform</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-top: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-section {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-section p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
